  "ruleText": "Ncr 853.01 Applicability. In addition to rules found in Ncr 852, the provisions of Ncr 853 shall apply to all bureau snowmobile trails on department properties.\n\nSource. #14288, eff 6-25-25, EXPIRES: 6-25-35",
